    "stem": "<p>(a) \\(A\\), \\(B\\), \\(C\\) and \\(D\\) are points on a circle, centre \\(O\\).</p><p>Angle \\(COD=124^\\circ\\) and angle \\(BCO=35^\\circ\\).</p><figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 368 288\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"ig194on21q5a-t ig194on21q5a-d\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:368px;height:auto\"><title id=\"ig194on21q5a-t\">Circle, centre O, with points A, B, C and D on the circumference, angle COD equal to 124 degrees and angle BCO equal to 35 degrees</title><desc id=\"ig194on21q5a-d\">A circle, centre O, with points A, B, C and D on the circumference. Radii OD and OC, and chords AD, AB, BC, BD and DC are drawn. Angle COD is marked 124 degrees and angle BCO is marked 35 degrees. A NOT TO SCALE label sits inside the picture, away from the edges.</desc><circle cx=\"170.0\" cy=\"140.0\" r=\"96.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"108.3\" y1=\"66.5\" x2=\"202.8\" y2=\"49.8\" stroke=\"#0b5cab\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"108.3\" y1=\"66.5\" x2=\"79.8\" y2=\"172.8\" stroke=\"#0b5cab\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"79.8\" y1=\"172.8\" x2=\"260.2\" y2=\"172.8\" stroke=\"#0b5cab\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"79.8\" y1=\"172.8\" x2=\"202.8\" y2=\"49.8\" stroke=\"#0b5cab\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"202.8\" y1=\"49.8\" x2=\"260.2\" y2=\"172.8\" stroke=\"#0b5cab\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"170.0\" y1=\"140.0\" x2=\"202.8\" y2=\"49.8\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"170.0\" y1=\"140.0\" x2=\"260.2\" y2=\"172.8\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"170.0\" cy=\"140.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\"/><path d=\"M 179.6 113.7 A 28 28 0 0 1 196.3 149.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><path d=\"M 236.2 172.8 A 24 24 0 0 1 237.7 164.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"154.0\" y=\"144.0\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">O</text><text x=\"94.3\" y=\"62.5\" font-size=\"13\"